Summary of changes:
- Import tags are now written as `@import {path} !file`.
- `addFileImports` queues the paths exactly as the LLM passed them.
- When a result message has import tags, its source path is set from `__file`. `loadImportsAsync` already passes `msg[convoMessageSourcePathKey]` as `sourceFilepath`, so relative paths resolve against the directory of `__file`.
- Imports that use `!docs` or `!docs:N` are registered under the key `{name} !{docsModifier}`. A later import of the same file without `!docs` uses the plain name as its key, so it is imported in full. Repeated `!docs` imports of the same file are still deduplicated.

Note: if `__file` is not set, relative paths fall back to being used as-is. In practice that means they resolve against the process cwd, not `__cwd`.


